UnitSimpleTransfersFactory::createSimpleTransfers
└── when creating a SimpleTransfers contract
    ├── it should deploy a SimpleTransfers contract with correct args
    └── it should match the parameters sent to the constructor

UnitSimpleTransfersFactory::createSimpleTransfer
└── when creating a SimpleTransfers contract with a single transfer action
    ├── it should deploy a SimpleTransfers contract with a single transfer action
    └── it should match the parameters sent to the constructor
